  "boundaries": [
    "No physical probe/firmware/GPU execution before39. Windows packer cross-compiled and shared PS7/starters inspected; no Windows host run.",
    "SMP4 fixture is a private image copy. Missing four optional AMD modules exercises first installation/removal; a valid different preload envelope exercises real BOOT replacement/rollback without inventing another component version.",
    "Normal COMMIT replaces files before reboot. Conservative two-boots rule covers interrupted early replay and requested rollback because Limine loads preloads first.",
    "Automatic UPDSVC may own post-boot verification; concurrent CLI busy is visible and next installed state is required. Later explicit checks await service readiness. An auxiliary STOP during finalization timed out and is not counted as a successful service-stop test; it is unnecessary for the transaction workflow.",
    "R4U preserves user settings/limine and updates MODULES.JSON through its owner. Recovery Full Update reformats SYSTEM; externally save and restore settings/data first.",
    "SYSUPD ROLLBACK-LAST restores only the latest transaction, not all three batches. Keep a separate known-good package/recovery path.",
    "Release ZIP uses pinned published Recovery0.1.59 and host structural/hash/budget validation; no physical installation or new Recovery artifact."
  ]
}
